  1057	On input $N$:
  1058	\begin{enumerate}[label=\arabic*.,start=0]
  1059	\item If $n<n_0$, run Harvey--Hittmeir and stop. If $N<4$ the output is trivial. If $N$ is
  1060	  even, output $2$ together with Harvey--Hittmeir's factorisation of $N/2$.
  1061	\item Run the detector (Lemma~\ref{lem:detector}) with $T$.
  1062	\item For $i=1,\dots,k$, run $\DCL_{n,H_i}$.
  1063	\item If no step produced a divisor, run Harvey--Hittmeir \cite{hh2022}, which outputs the
  1064	  complete factorisation.
  1065	\end{enumerate}
  1066	\emph{Finish.} As soon as a step outputs a proper divisor $d$, test $d$ and $N/d$ for primality
  1067	with AKS \cite{aks2004}. If both are prime, output $\{d,N/d\}$; otherwise run Harvey--Hittmeir on
  1068	$N$. On $\Sn$ the finish never calls Harvey--Hittmeir.
