  1668	For any support $I$ with $0\notin I$, $|I|=K$, and measurable $E$,
  1669	$|\{t\in J:G(t)\in E\}|\le C_I(|E|/\|b\|_\infty)^{1/K}$, where $G(t)=\sum b_it^i$.
