  1671	\noindent\emph{Sketch.} The generalised Wronskian of $\{t^i\}_{i\in I}$ is nonzero. So $J$ splits
  1672	into $O_I(1)$ pieces on each of which some derivative $|G^{(k)}|$, $k\le K$, is at least
