  1675	\begin{lemma}[denominators]\label{lem:K}
  1676	If $h_\tau$ satisfies integrality, then $C_{d_0}M_\tau^{K_\tau}\alpha_{\tau,i}\in\Z$, with
  1677	$C_{d_0}$ supported on primes at most $2d_0$.
