  1719	most $4^{\omega(M)}\gcd(A,B,M)$ admissible unit classes, which gives $h^2N^{o(1)}$ pairs per
  1720	modulus. Then optimise $\sum1/\eta$. Full proofs are in \texttt{notes/multimod\_results.md} \S3
  1721	and \texttt{notes/cycloharvey\_results.md} \S3.
  1722	\end{proof}
